  <h2>Using the service</h2>
  <p>QR Workbench provides browser-based tools for generating QR codes from data you supply, including a bulk workspace for generating many codes from a spreadsheet. The individual generators are free to use, with no signup required. By using QR Workbench, you agree to these terms.</p>

