  <h2>Format behavior</h2>
  <p>WiFi, vCard, email, SMS, and phone codes are built to the relevant open format specification (the WiFi QR format, vCard 3.0, and the <code>mailto:</code>/<code>sms:</code>/<code>tel:</code> URI schemes). Whether a given scanning app or device correctly interprets a code built to that specification is outside QR Workbench's control — see the <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>.</p>

